  "description": "meme-id: obama_nuts_meme; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts Barack and Michelle Obama smiling together at a formal event. The overlaid text poses a vulgar, violent hypothetical question: 'if you could kick an obama in the nuts which would it be?'. This is a hateful meme that targets the Obamas as individuals by invoking a crude, violent, and degrading physical assault metaphor. The intent is to provoke shock, ridicule, or contempt toward the subjects based on their identity as a Black couple in a position of power. The meme uses the juxtaposition of their dignified public image with the grotesque, violent text to demean them. This constitutes a direct attack on individuals based on their race and public status, falling under the category of hateful content. The meme is not merely humorous or satirical; it is intentionally offensive and degrading, aiming to insult the subjects through violent and vulgar imagery.",
